 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Two ways to say you like something",
     "texto": [
      "For things, the verb **mögen** is used: **Ich mag Fisch** (I like fish). It is irregular: **ich mag, du magst, er mag**.",
      "For actions, **gern** is added to the verb: **Ich esse gern Fisch** (I like eating fish; literally «I eat fish with pleasure»), **Ich trinke gern Tee**.",
      "Negation: **Ich mag keinen Fisch** and **Ich esse nicht gern Fisch**.",
      "To say you prefer something else: **lieber**. **Ich trinke lieber Tee** (I prefer to drink tea)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Likes",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "German",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "English",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
      [
       {
        "texto": "Ich mag Kaffee.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "I like coffee.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "Ich trinke gern Kaffee.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "I like drinking coffee.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "Ich trinke nicht gern Kaffee.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "I don't like drinking coffee.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "Ich trinke lieber Tee.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "I prefer to drink tea.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ]
     ],
     "nota": "",
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Eating and drinking",
     "texto": [
      "**Essen** (to eat) changes its vowel: **ich esse, du isst, er isst**. **Trinken** (to drink) is regular.",
      "When you talk about food in general, no article is used: **Ich esse Brot** (I eat bread).",
      "**Zum Frühstück** = for breakfast. **Jeden Morgen** = every morning."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
